[h1]SaucedCarts v2.1.11[/h1]
[i]Released: 2026-05-31[/i]

[b]Outdoor cart spawns reworked to use real parking lots and driveways, with much wider indoor coverage and a multiplayer corpse-loot fix.[/b]

[h1]What's New[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Outdoor carts now spawn in real parking lots and driveways.[/b] Carts use the same map zones the game uses to spawn cars — store lots, residential driveways, trailer-park parking — instead of rarely appearing outdoors at all. New sandbox option [b]"Outdoor Cart Spawns"[/b] (Off / Low / Medium / High, default Medium) controls how often.
[*][b]Indoor coverage expanded from 36 to 83 room types[/b] — drugstores, toy stores, hardware/auto/BBQ/paint shops, gas marts, back-of-house storage, industrial docks, and garages. Common building types now reliably produce carts.
[*][b]Addon cart types mix into outdoor spawns automatically[/b], with no addon changes required.
[/list]

[h1]Bug Fixes[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Multiplayer: looting an item from a zombie or corpse straight into a held cart now works.[/b] Previously the transfer silently did nothing.
[/list]

[h1]Compatibility[/h1]
[list]
[*][b]Save-safe.[/b] No save-data changes — safe to upgrade mid-save.
[*][b]Addon authors:[/b] the cart-registration API is unchanged (the optional [i]outdoorWeight[/i] knob defaults sensibly).
[/list]
